# Files of the Gold Edition that Weiler loads, relative to the game folder (the folder with DATA and GFX).
# Used by weiler-pack-data and by the game when it takes over a folder chosen by the player. Names are matched
# without regard to case and stored in upper case; '*' and '?' work in the last part of a line.
#   !  required, identifies the game folder (same list in src/engine/DataPaths.cpp)
#   ?  optional (own maps)
# Not needed: the DOS programs, videos, the editor files, mission texts and pictures of the original menus.
!DATA/RESOURCE.DAT
DATA/RESOURCE.IDX
DATA/BOOT_Z.LST
DATA/MAP_0_Z.LST
DATA/MAP_1_Z.LST
DATA/MAP_2_Z.LST
DATA/MIS?BOBS.LST
!DATA/BOBS/JOBS.BOB
DATA/BOBS/CARRIER.BOB
DATA/BOBS/BOAT.LST
DATA/CBOB/ROM_BOBS.LST
!DATA/IO/IO.DAT
DATA/IO/IO.IDX
!DATA/MBOB/ROM_Z.LST
DATA/MBOB/*_Z.LST
DATA/MBOB/*_ICON.LST
!DATA/SOUNDDAT/SOUND.LST
DATA/MAPS/*.WLD
DATA/MAPS2/*.WLD
DATA/MAPS3/*.WLD
DATA/MAPS4/*.WLD
?DATA/MAPS2/*.SWD
?DATA/MAPS3/*.SWD
?DATA/MAPS4/*.SWD
!GFX/PALETTE/PAL5.BBM
GFX/PALETTE/*.BBM
GFX/TEXTURES/TEX5.LBM
GFX/TEXTURES/TEX6.LBM
GFX/TEXTURES/TEX7.LBM
?WORLDS/*.WLD
?WORLDS/*.SWD
